    "title": "Police investigating death in Southeast Cape Coral - NewsBreak",
    "text": "On Wednesday Cape Coral Police were called out to a home on SE 3rd Ave in Southeast Cape Coral to investigate a death. At 11 pm the Police Department told FOX 4 it appears to be a suicide. There were multiple police cars, an ambulance and crime scene tape up, when FOX 4 crews arrived at 8 pm. Neighbors told us this is usually a very quiet neighborhood but then there were lots of sirens and police. This is a developing story, check back here at fox4now.com for more information when it is released.",
